{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91","id":"pg_5bd45ef241615610954d801c5346a14c","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/juyterman1000-entroly-gemini-md-9bab5850955c-801c5346a14c.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_18376e079edd5dfaa2cc2080e8f5ed1f"],"title":"juyterman1000/entroly/GEMINI.md @ 9bab5850955c","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:02:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da330bd541454890be1bdf822b64fe91"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_109c939154c2848f0655334d8e7f4e02f92e7ba418b044de76fe53d1554f0f3a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Rust-accelerated engine is available via PyO3 and WASM, and a standalone Rust binary can be built from entroly-core with cargo using the proxy feature."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2747031c25e77111c11080a40941f1a18fcaa0f43bf5a181fa5fd0e03855105a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Output token reduction uses a three-layer pipeline: effort classification steers verbosity directives, max_tokens budgets cap generation, and post-generation distillation trims filler."},{"claim_ids":["clm_31d31f36e450ceef441b1ec570d3babe5aa2f155f073fd14119d813267ebf1d8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors are directed to a reproducible development setup in CONTRIBUTING.md, and local installation plus the normal test suite need no API key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3ea9906cd3d23c004b82d33d2d5e2f584774eb0e71cf86a17f410a8cfa6b8b40"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The MCP server is configured with environment flags such as ENTROLY_NO_DOCKER, ENTROLY_MCP_PASSIVE, and ENTROLY_MAX_FILES, and the MCP path is provider-neutral across many model vendors."},{"claim_ids":["clm_551e8021d8b300c19859550e0f6a632af04b9a2db97bebc609283a06d515aea7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Benchmark tables report accuracy retention with gpt-4o-mini and Wilson 95% CIs across NeedleInAHaystack, GSM8K, SQuAD 2.0, MMLU, TruthfulQA, and LongBench, with an average retention of 101.7%."},{"claim_ids":["clm_64e412b2c005ef9438889441f89bd7854a1102d5ea15c2b2a9bf018402042fd4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Stated good fits are large repos where agents see few files at a time, chatty multi-turn agents, and evidence-checked answers; tiny repos or prompts already within budget are cases to skip."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6712bf6b8efbdf9f184a2e304f9097b1f6b969f1075b6a640bead1ab0722c00a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"If the native engine is missing, Entroly installs it from PyPI before measuring; this self-heal is the only outbound call of these commands and can be disabled with ENTROLY_NO_SELF_HEAL=1."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6a5fea4bd8fa2828ee66c7536c3f72f1f1d98beb770e9abcc73f5ff48b1d8f54"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README lists six research algorithms with named implementation files, including a provenance tracer (Python), and nkbe, causal, cognitive_bus, and resonance modules in a Rust core (entroly-core)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a9dd57dcc2fb0b74edb57d8e2b922427260680631f908ecb86042c1e7b8bb5f5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README candidly notes a regression: SQuAD 2.0 accuracy dropped from 80% to 72% with compression, and points users to entroly simulate for their own numbers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_acab2812b0ee0d6881c84aeb8ccc6062fc5252a31b1053ffef255cff5d0f61db"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cross-agent shared memory is a content-addressed store with SimHash deduplication and BM25 search, letting multiple agents share a knowledge base with provenance tracking."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b1f8534d1555b0ab876b5c01db645fd21d2d954cd029ca2046b45c75c24182ce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product runs as a CLI, Python/TypeScript SDK, MCP server, HTTP proxy, or library import, per the README's product-surface description."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bc7ccbc0df959e45dc347edad8608ea63890a4a67fd8df124293ea2872d20db0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Python SDK exposes functions such as compress, compress_messages, optimize, shared_memory_write, and shared_memory_search, with budget and query parameters shown in examples."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cd71cf3373611f9938e2b1b7274e650c05672a270262bc71d954c9cecce32122"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Entroly is described as a local-first AI token-efficiency and context-assurance layer offering budgeted evidence selection, recoverable compression, content-addressed recovery, and auditable receipts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e5be4c02de8c9ba323c4fb83989fef0aadc87108d36825666249e0be78525ae7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A WITNESS hallucination detector is reported at 84.92% accuracy and 0.7976 AUROC on 20,000 HaluEval-QA decisions, run locally without an API."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e99f0be5ab3cbf2d4c0adff059ffc7308a9a90162d674837e07ef251bb01b3b7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README states savings are not a universal guarantee, that MCP-only integrations remain tools an agent may skip, and that provider-bound savings exist only when requests traverse an Entroly-controlled route."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f945930fdae2c8c9adc72bd9e504837dd99552fa1265daf776f39dd095db2385"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Authorization in the govern subsystem is deny-by-default, and every denial names the policy and reason; identity tokens are unsigned unless ENTROLY_IDENTITY_KEY is set."}],"claim_ids":["clm_109c939154c2848f0655334d8e7f4e02f92e7ba418b044de76fe53d1554f0f3a","clm_2747031c25e77111c11080a40941f1a18fcaa0f43bf5a181fa5fd0e03855105a","clm_31d31f36e450ceef441b1ec570d3babe5aa2f155f073fd14119d813267ebf1d8","clm_3ea9906cd3d23c004b82d33d2d5e2f584774eb0e71cf86a17f410a8cfa6b8b40","clm_551e8021d8b300c19859550e0f6a632af04b9a2db97bebc609283a06d515aea7","clm_64e412b2c005ef9438889441f89bd7854a1102d5ea15c2b2a9bf018402042fd4","clm_6712bf6b8efbdf9f184a2e304f9097b1f6b969f1075b6a640bead1ab0722c00a","clm_6a5fea4bd8fa2828ee66c7536c3f72f1f1d98beb770e9abcc73f5ff48b1d8f54","clm_a9dd57dcc2fb0b74edb57d8e2b922427260680631f908ecb86042c1e7b8bb5f5","clm_acab2812b0ee0d6881c84aeb8ccc6062fc5252a31b1053ffef255cff5d0f61db","clm_b1f8534d1555b0ab876b5c01db645fd21d2d954cd029ca2046b45c75c24182ce","clm_bc7ccbc0df959e45dc347edad8608ea63890a4a67fd8df124293ea2872d20db0","clm_cd71cf3373611f9938e2b1b7274e650c05672a270262bc71d954c9cecce32122","clm_e5be4c02de8c9ba323c4fb83989fef0aadc87108d36825666249e0be78525ae7","clm_e99f0be5ab3cbf2d4c0adff059ffc7308a9a90162d674837e07ef251bb01b3b7","clm_f945930fdae2c8c9adc72bd9e504837dd99552fa1265daf776f39dd095db2385"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:0